      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5f2e0a4e8464150716ffd322|full_name}For now, there are no issues without making any changes, but please check the current VRC Layer names. You'll be surprised. :)\n\nIn particular, layers 6 and 7 can be renamed and are reserved by VRChat.\n\nhttps://creators.vrchat.com/worlds/layers",
